DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering Person1\, whose 23rd Yahrzeit 
 occurs on Tuesday\, December 8\, corresponding to the 28th of Kislev\, 578
 7.\n\nPerson1’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Monday\, December 7 and co
 ntinues until sundown on the day of observance. It is customary to light a
  memorial candle at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your loved one’s
  soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and may their memory serve a
 s a continued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
